      "artist": "Rjluna2",
      "description": "Erected under the auspices\nof the Old Guard\nand Atlanta Chapter U.D.C.\nA.D. 1919 in memory of\nAndrew J. West\nbeloved citizen\nCaptain C.S.A.-General U.C.V.\n-\nThe damage at the base of\nthis lamp post was caused\nby a shell during the war\nbetween the States,\nBattle of Atlanta\nJuly 22nd 1864.\n\nThe Eternal Flame\nof the Confederacy\n-\nLighted during the\n\"Gone with the Wind\" Festivities\nDecember 14, 1939\nby the\nOld Guard Battalion\n\nof the Gate City Guard",
